[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0020","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0030","text":"辛苦了，小糸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0040","text":"是、是的……辛苦了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0050","text":"今天的小糸，表现得非常好哦！\n让很多人都露出了笑容呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0060","text":"诶……真、真的……吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0070","text":"可是，我……\n…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0080","text":"……制、制作人这么觉得的话，\n一、一定……就是这样吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0090","text":"嘿嘿……我、我会更加努力练习的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22200200_03_0100","text":"为了能呈现更棒的舞台……！"}]
